{"seq":1,"slug":"royalty-calculation-engine","title":"特许权使用费计算引擎与结算对账","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-ip-licensing-royalty-customs/royalty-system-operations/royalty-calculation-engine","wordCount":2369,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"特许权使用费计算引擎与结算对账\">特许权使用费计算引擎与结算对账</h1><p>当一家公司同时持有几十份跨境许可协议、每份的基数定义、费率结构、结算周期和分摊规则都不同时，&quot;人工按合同算一遍再手工填申报表&quot;这条路径会在第一个季度结算就崩掉：同一笔许可费，财务按 IFRS 15 确认收入的口径、海关按完税价格归集的口径、许可方按合同对账的口径，三者数字对不上，争议从一处变成三处。本文只解决工程问题——如何把一个可复算、可审计、能与三方账本对上的<strong>特许权使用费计算引擎</strong>建起来，并把每期结算做成一份可追溯的对账单。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>特许权使用费计算引擎要把合同条款翻译成可复算的确定性逻辑，关键概念有四个：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>基数 × 费率 × 分摊</strong>：每期权利金 = 计提基数（净销售额/使用量等）× 费率 × 应税/归属分摊系数，三个变量都要版本化、可追溯到合同字段。</li>\n<li><strong>三套口径并行</strong>：同一次计算要同时输出 IFRS 收入确认口径、海关完税价格加计口径、合同对账口径，三者不同但必须能从同一套底层数据推导。</li>\n<li><strong>幂等与可审计</strong>：每一期结算用「许可+期间+版本」做幂等键，结果只追加不改写，并保留从结果回溯到原始交易与合同条款的证据链。</li>\n<li><strong>常见误解</strong>：把引擎做成一张静态费率表；真正的难点在基数口径、阶梯/最低保证金、币种与汇率、以及多辖区分摊，而不是费率本身。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"计算引擎要吃掉四类输入\">计算引擎要吃掉四类输入</h2><p>一个可用的许可费引擎，输入不是&quot;销售额乘以费率&quot;这么简单。它必须把 <a href=\"../licensing-royalty-model/royalty-base-and-rate-model\">特许权使用费基数与费率模型</a> 里拆出的变量，以及 <a href=\"../licensing-royalty-model/license-contract-terms-model\">许可合同条款建模</a> 里的支付约定，组装成一张可版本化的计算契约：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>基数口径</strong>——毛销售额 / 净销售额 / 进口货物对应销售额。净销售额的扣减项（退货、折扣、运费、税费）必须逐项定义，否则每期对账都会因为&quot;是否扣运费&quot;产生分歧。</li>\n<li><strong>费率结构</strong>——固定费率、阶梯费率、最低保证金（minimum guarantee）、封顶（cap）、以及混合型（保底 + 超额分成）。</li>\n<li><strong>结算与分摊规则</strong>——按季度/按票/按年结算，一次性支付如何在多批进口货物间分摊。</li>\n<li><strong>时间与货币坐标</strong>——权责发生期间、汇率取值日、舍入规则。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这四类输入在数据库里不能是文档，而要是结构化字段：把合同语言翻译成机读配置，是引擎能复算的前提。任何只以 PDF 附件形式存在的扣减项定义，都会在审计时变成不可执行的迷雾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从合同字段到完税价格-计算流水线\">从合同字段到完税价格：计算流水线</h2><p>引擎的核心是一条五段流水线，每一段都产出中间结果并落库，任何一期数字都能沿链路回放到原始凭证。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[合同配置版本 v] --&gt; B[取数: 期间销售额 / 进口明细]&#10;    B --&gt; C[算子1: 按基数口径聚合净额 B]&#10;    C --&gt; D[算子2: 应用费率 r 含阶梯/保底/封顶]&#10;    D --&gt; E[算子3: 期间应计许可费 R = B x r]&#10;    E --&gt; F[算子4: 分摊到进口批次/期间]&#10;    F --&gt; G[算子5: 按汇率与舍入折算本币]&#10;    G --&gt; H[输出: 完税价格加计表 + 台账分录]&#10;    H --&gt; I[对账: 财务总账 / 申报单 / 许可方账单]&#10;    I --&gt;|差异| J[差异分析并出具调整分录]&#10;    I --&gt;|一致| K[锁定期间并留档]\">flowchart TD\n    A[合同配置版本 v] --&gt; B[取数: 期间销售额 / 进口明细]\n    B --&gt; C[算子1: 按基数口径聚合净额 B]\n    C --&gt; D[算子2: 应用费率 r 含阶梯/保底/封顶]\n    D --&gt; E[算子3: 期间应计许可费 R = B x r]\n    E --&gt; F[算子4: 分摊到进口批次/期间]\n    F --&gt; G[算子5: 按汇率与舍入折算本币]\n    G --&gt; H[输出: 完税价格加计表 + 台账分录]\n    H --&gt; I[对账: 财务总账 / 申报单 / 许可方账单]\n    I --&gt;|差异| J[差异分析并出具调整分录]\n    I --&gt;|一致| K[锁定期间并留档]</pre><p>期间应计许可费是流水线的心脏：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>period</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>SKU</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{period}} = \\sum_{i \\in \\text{SKU}} B_i \\times r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">period</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">SKU</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 SKU <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 在本期间的合格基数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是对应费率。当合同含保底条款时，实际支付额是应计额与保底额的较大值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>period</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>G</mi><mtext>minimum</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Payable = \\max\\left(R_{\\text{period}},\\ G_{\\text{minimum}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">period</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">minimum</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>含封顶时再取上界的较小值。<strong>关键工程点</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>period</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{period}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">period</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Payable</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 必须分别落库。前者用于完税价格分摊，后者用于现金流与许可方对账——两者混为一谈，是后期对账差异最常见的根因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分摊-把一笔年度许可费拆到每一批进口货物\">分摊：把一笔年度许可费拆到每一批进口货物</h2><p>海关口径下，一笔覆盖多年或多个 SKU 的许可费不能整笔塞进单批进口货物。若合同未约定分摊方法，中国实务常用按进口货物价值占比分摊（见 <a href=\"../customs-valuation-mechanism/royalty-condition-of-sale\">特许权使用费与销售条件判定</a>）。引擎里的分摊算子做的是同一件事：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_j = R \\times \\frac{V_j}{\\sum_{k=1}^{n} V_k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3543em;vertical-align:-0.994em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3057em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.994em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 批进口货物的完税价格，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是分摊到该批的许可费。工程上有三个必须固化进配置的约定：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>分摊基数必须与申报口径同源</strong>——用财务销售额分摊，却申报海关完税价格，两侧基数不一致会直接产生差额。</li>\n<li><strong>分摊结果要能反向汇总回总额</strong>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_j C_j = R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>（在舍入容差内），否则台账无法闭环。</li>\n<li><strong>汇率取值日固定</strong>——按报关日、纳税义务发生日或月末中间价，三者取其一并写入配置，不能用&quot;当期均值&quot;这种事后无法复现的口径。折算公式朴素但必须锚定参数：</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mi>j</mi><mtext>local</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mi>j</mi><mtext>foreign</mtext></msubsup><mo>×</mo><mi>F</mi><msub><mi>X</mi><mrow><mtext>as of </mtext><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C^{\\text{local}}_j = C^{\\text{foreign}}_j \\times FX_{\\text{as of } d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2822em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">local</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.38em;vertical-align:-0.413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">foreign</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.413em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">as of </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>币种代码统一采用 ISO 4217 三字母码（如 USD、CNY、EUR），避免中文别名造成的匹配歧义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三方对账-引擎数字必须同时对上三本账\">三方对账：引擎数字必须同时对上三本账</h2><p>结算对账的本质是让同一个许可费数字在三套账本里一致，不一致则定位差异来源：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>账本</th>\n<th>数字来源</th>\n<th>常见差异原因</th>\n<th>处理动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>财务总账</td>\n<td>IFRS 15 / ASC 606 下按权责发生确认的许可费费用</td>\n<td>期间归属口径不同、含未付应计</td>\n<td>出具权责差异调节表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>许可方账单</td>\n<td>权利人按合同自算并开票的金额</td>\n<td>基数扣减项定义分歧、保底/封顶计算差异</td>\n<td>引合同条款对账并出调整分录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>申报台账</td>\n<td>引擎分摊后计入完税价格的金额</td>\n<td>汇率取值日不同、分摊基数口径不一致</td>\n<td>重算并触发补充申报</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对账不是逐笔比对，而是先做<strong>总量勾稽</strong>（三方期间总额是否落在容差内），再对超容差项做<strong>逐 SKU 下钻</strong>。工程实现上，对账模块只做一件事：给定期间，输出一张差异清单，每行标注差异金额、命中的合同条款编号、以及建议的调整类型（调整分录 / 补充申报 / 退回许可方核对）。把差异归因自动化，是引擎区别于&quot;Excel 模板&quot;的分水岭——Excel 能算数，但不会告诉你差异出自哪一条合同条款。</p>\n<h2 id=\"影响引擎设计的几条外部规则\">影响引擎设计的几条外部规则</h2><p>引擎不是通用计算器，它的舍入、取值与分摊规则都被外部法规和会计准则约束：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>WTO《海关估价协定》第 8.1(c) 条</strong>及其解释性说明，界定了哪些支付应加计、复制权费如何排除——这决定了引擎里&quot;合格基数&quot;的过滤器逻辑（<a href=\"https://www.wto.org/english/tratop_e/cusval_e/cusval_info_e.htm\">WTO Customs Valuation</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>中国海关总署令第 213 号</strong>确立&quot;与货物有关 + 构成销售条件&quot;的判定与分摊要求，是申报台账口径的依据。</li>\n<li><strong>欧盟 UCC（Regulation (EU) No 952/2013）第 71 条</strong>成文排除复制权费，若引擎服务欧盟进口，需为&quot;复制权费&quot;设置独立标志位以自动剔除（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2013/952/oj\">Regulation (EU) No 952/2013</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>美国 19 CFR 152.103(f)</strong> 以 condition of sale 为核心，并要求可明确分拆的售后支持不计入，对应引擎中&quot;可分离费用&quot;字段（<a href=\"https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-19/chapter-I/part-152\">19 CFR 152.103</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>ISO 4217</strong> 规范币种代码，<strong>Incoterms 2020</strong> 规范贸易术语——两者是取数与折算模块的基础字典。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些规则在引擎里表现为<strong>可配置的过滤器与标志位</strong>，而非硬编码分支：法规会变，配置版本号让每次变更都可追溯、可回放。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可复算性-引擎的质量门\">可复算性：引擎的质量门</h2><p>一个许可费引擎是否合格，不看它算得快不快，而看它是否满足三条可复算性要求：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>同输入必得同输出</strong>——给定合同版本号、期间、汇率参数，重跑任意次数结果一致。所有随机性（如四舍五入的中间步骤）都要显式定义。</li>\n<li><strong>每个数字可回放到凭证</strong>——从完税价格加计表能一路点回到合同条款、销售明细、汇率来源。审计要的不是结论，是路径。</li>\n<li><strong>差异可归因</strong>——每次对账差异都能自动标注命中条款与调整类型，而非留下一句&quot;待核实&quot;。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>把这三条写进引擎的验收清单，等同于把 <a href=\"../licensing-royalty-model/royalty-base-and-rate-model\">基数与费率模型</a> 的建模成果锁进不可漂移的实现里。下一章将处理这些台账与申报动作如何落地到具体的报关与预裁定流程中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>权利金计算引擎的本质是把合同条款（基数、费率、分摊、最低保证金、币种）翻译成版本化、确定性、幂等的计算，一次输入并行产出 IFRS、海关与合同三套口径。</li>\n<li>引擎的可信度来自可复算性：同输入同输出、每个数字可回放到凭证、每次对账差异可归因，法规差异通过可配置标志位而非硬编码实现。</li>\n<li>引擎不是孤立系统，它向上承接合同与基数/费率建模，向下驱动结算对账、支付预提税与许可出口申报的整条数据链。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"特许权使用费计算引擎与结算对账","id":"特许权使用费计算引擎与结算对账"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"计算引擎要吃掉四类输入","id":"计算引擎要吃掉四类输入"},{"level":2,"text":"从合同字段到完税价格：计算流水线","id":"从合同字段到完税价格-计算流水线"},{"level":2,"text":"分摊：把一笔年度许可费拆到每一批进口货物","id":"分摊-把一笔年度许可费拆到每一批进口货物"},{"level":2,"text":"三方对账：引擎数字必须同时对上三本账","id":"三方对账-引擎数字必须同时对上三本账"},{"level":2,"text":"影响引擎设计的几条外部规则","id":"影响引擎设计的几条外部规则"},{"level":2,"text":"可复算性：引擎的质量门","id":"可复算性-引擎的质量门"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"关联方交易与转让定价的估价衔接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-ip-licensing-royalty-customs/customs-valuation-mechanism/related-party-transfer-pricing"},"next":{"title":"跨境权利金支付与预提税汇兑处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-ip-licensing-royalty-customs/royalty-system-operations/crossborder-payment-withholding-tax"}}